--[[
    PUMPKIN AUTO-COLLECTOR — Minimal Toggle UI (v5.2 beside-teleport)
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    Same 220×62 widget. Single switch.

    Key change: character teleports BESIDE the pumpkin (3-6 studs out),
    not on top of it. The prompt then appears naturally within its own
    MaxActivationDistance and fires cleanly.

    • Stand distance = pumpkin radius + 3 studs (clamped inside prompt range)
    • Ground raycast ensures you land on a valid surface
    • Character faces the pumpkin (camera naturally shows prompt)
    • 8 stand directions — rotated on each retry (handles walls/corners)
    • No prompt property mutation — pure natural trigger
    • Per-pumpkin blacklist after 3 failed attempts
    • Auto-resumes after death/respawn

    Requirements:
      • Executor with fireproximityprompt (preferred) OR
      • Executor with fireclickdetector (for ClickDetector pumpkins)
      • Falls back to InputHoldBegin/End if neither exists
]]

